# Units: coords are dbu; layout.dbu=0.00025µm → 1 dbu = 0.25 nm, 1 nm = 4 dbu. DRC rules are in nm (deck≠crop units); multiply nm×4 to compare in dbu.
layout = pya.Layout()
layout.dbu = 0.00025
cell_Block7 = layout.create_cell("Block7")
# === layer band ===
# editable layers: M2, M3, M4, M5, M6
# background layers: V7 (view-only; do NOT edit)

# --- A. via instances (this crop OWNS these). Editable TWO ways:
#   (1) whole instance -> move_instance / delete_instance;
#   (2) SHARED via cell structure -> resize_via_shape / move_via_shape on its
#       internal metal LANDS (M*) and V-CUT (V*). This edits the ONE shared
#       VIA_* cell definition, so EVERY instance of that via type changes
#       together (cell name + all placements unchanged). ---
